---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
active: home
permalink: /
---
<div class="page page--home">

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="hero__kicker">A training program for Hunters</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Crucible <em>College</em></h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">A structured Destiny&nbsp;2 Crucible course for the Hunter class. Setup, settings,
    and movement — taught in order, one lesson at a time, so every match you play becomes practice
    instead of noise.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/lessons/{{ curriculum.lessons[0].slug }}/">Begin Lesson 1</a>
      <a class="button" href="/curriculum/">View the curriculum</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ticker__track">
      <span>TTK <b>·</b> optimal shots to kill</span><span>Meta <b>·</b> what the sandbox rewards</span><span>Strafe Jump <b>·</b> air control wins duels</span><span>Flinch <b>·</b> the aim-punch of being shot</span><span>Radar <b>·</b> direction, not headcount</span><span>Dodge to cover <b>·</b> never open ground</span><span>TTK <b>·</b> optimal shots to kill</span><span>Meta <b>·</b> what the sandbox rewards</span><span>Strafe Jump <b>·</b> air control wins duels</span><span>Flinch <b>·</b> the aim-punch of being shot</span><span>Radar <b>·</b> direction, not headcount</span><span>Dodge to cover <b>·</b> never open ground</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="resume-heading">
    <h2 id="resume-heading">Continue training</h2>
    <a class="resume-card" data-resume href="/lessons/{{ curriculum.lessons[0].slug }}/">
      <span class="seal seal--lg" data-resume-seal aria-hidden="true"><span data-resume-tag>{{ curriculum.lessons[0].tag }}</span></span>
      <span class="resume-card__text">
        <span class="resume-card__kicker" data-resume-kicker>New here? Start at the beginning</span>
        <span class="resume-card__title" data-resume-title>Lesson {{ curriculum.lessons[0].tag }} — {{ curriculum.lessons[0].title }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="resume-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="home-grid">
    <div class="home-panel">
      <h2>What the course covers</h2>
      <ol class="chapter-list">
        {% for chapter in curriculum.chapters %}
        <li>
          <span class="chapter-list__number">Ch. {{ chapter.number }}</span>
          <span class="chapter-list__title">{{ chapter.title }}</span>
          <span class="chapter-list__count">{{ chapter.lessons.length }} lesson{% if chapter.lessons.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      <p class="home-panel__note">More chapters are on the syllabus — aim training, dueling, and game
      sense are coming as the course grows.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-panel">
      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <p>Beginner-to-intermediate Hunter mains. If you can finish a Crucible match but can't say
      <em>why</em> you lost it — or you're winning on instinct and want a foundation under it —
      you're in the right cohort. No competitive experience is assumed.</p>
      <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
      <ul class="prereq-list">
        <li>Destiny 2 installed, with a Hunter character you're willing to main</li>
        <li>Basic comfort with the controls — you've played enough PvE to move and shoot without thinking</li>
        <li>A tolerance for losing matches on purpose while you drill new habits</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
